{%- set a = sponsors.audience -%}
<main class="container sponsor-page">
  <section>
    <h1>Sponsor the Lenches newsletter</h1>
    <p class="lead">The Lenches Website and its free weekly newsletter keep five villages in touch: events, news, roads, bins and local services, all in one place. Each month, one local business can support it.</p>

    <h2>Your business, in front of local homeowners</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Around {{ a.subscribers }} subscribers every Thursday morning.</li>
      <li>Around {{ a.visitsPerMonth | string | replace(r/\B(?=(\d{3})+(?!\d))/g, ",") }} website visits a month.</li>
      <li>You're the only sponsor that month, with no other adverts beside you.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Seen in a good light</h2>
    <p>A positive, trusted community newsletter, with no politics, no gambling and nothing to argue about. Your name sits alongside village events, church services and local news that people actually read.</p>

    <h2>Supporting your community</h2>
    <p>Your sponsorship keeps a free community resource running for everyone in the villages. It's a simple, visible part of your corporate social responsibility. 100% of sponsorship money goes towards the running costs of the website and newsletter.</p>

    <h2>What you get</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>A &ldquo;Supported this month by&rdquo; band with your logo, name, one line and a link near the top of every issue that month.</li>
      <li>The same at the top of the website's home page for the whole month.</li>
      <li>A thank-you mention in the newsletter.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Price</h2>
    <p class="price"><strong>&pound;{{ sponsors.price }} for the calendar month.</strong></p>
    <p>It's usually an allowable business expense, but check with your accountant. We're not VAT registered.</p>

    <h2>Easy to arrange</h2>
    <p>Reply to our email, or write to <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}?subject=Sponsoring%20the%20newsletter">{{ site.email }}</a>, with the month you'd like, your logo and a line of up to 15 words. Pay by bank transfer or card, and you're done.</p>

    <h2>Even easier to repeat</h2>
    <p>One month at a time, with no contract to tie you in. To book again, just reply &ldquo;same again&rdquo;.</p>

    <h2>Our promise</h2>
    <p>Sponsorship never affects our news, listings or recommendations, and we never share subscriber details with anyone.</p>

    <p><a href="{{ '/newsletter/' | url }}">See what the newsletter is about</a> &middot; <a href="{{ '/sponsor/terms/' | url }}">Sponsorship terms</a></p>
  </section>
